{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_chat_106_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_chat_106_1000_019min", "source_sha256": "96bdabf6c3cb8d39b344089e01890cb4f03bcb3b25e6fea3f4e5da84272acbf7", "ja": "う～ん、見つからないなぁ……。\n環ちゃん、星梨花ちゃん、\nそっちはどう？", "zh": "嗯……找不到啊……\n环、星梨花，\n你们那边怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_chat_106_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_chat_106_1001_040tam", "source_sha256": "e9212357bebf1877c4ce9d74c73666e44748e6265566028917ceb443c667213a", "ja": "ううん、こっちにもない……。\nどこに行っちゃったんだろう、\nたまきのハンカチ……。", "zh": "没有，这边也没有……\n到底掉到哪里去了呢，\n环的手帕……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_chat_106_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_chat_106_1002_022ser", "source_sha256": "f2f301e7aa59c45d3ef85d8c7f8234a086b56b290b3251579d6549fbe98e0eaf", "ja": "控え室じゃないんでしょうか……\nあっ。そろそろ、レッスンが\n始まる時間ですね。", "zh": "会不会在休息室呢……\n啊，差不多到上课的时间了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_chat_106_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_chat_106_1003_019min", "source_sha256": "0655eab895cf20f5e753d0fd829f1d077ceb032c0e2262d03a59830dba46c3f2", "ja": "本当だ、もうこんな時間！\n急いでレッスンルームに\n行かないと！", "zh": "真的，已经这么晚了！\n得赶紧去练习室才行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_chat_106_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_chat_106_1004_019min", "source_sha256": "ad050bd27e365cfb6fad45ef6cea2b39abc1080820f3c71aee89bcbccce65b3e", "ja": "環ちゃん、ハンカチを探すのは\nレッスンの後でもいい？\n見つかるまで、一緒に探すから。", "zh": "小环，手帕可以等练习结束后再找吗？\n在找到之前，我会陪你一起找。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_chat_106_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_chat_106_1005_040tam", "source_sha256": "e9c3862569d9fb4749c62f59264390d3d250ecb8cc7ae1246c5c9497745690ec", "ja": "みなこ……うん！\nありがとー！", "zh": "美奈子……嗯！谢谢你——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
